Budget Tracker - Final UI/UX, Responsive & Theme Polish

Please carefully review the entire application and fix all remaining UI/UX issues without changing any business logic or existing functionality. The goal is to make the app production-ready, clean, responsive, and visually consistent on both Desktop and Mobile.

1. Desktop Header Layout

Desktop header abhi bhi properly organized nahi hai.

Main sirf yeh 5 buttons header ke bahar visible chahta hoon:

🧮 Calculator
💱 Currency Change
⚙️ Form & App Settings
🔒 PIN Lock Settings
🌙☀️ Dark / Light Mode

In buttons ko kisi bhi Tools dropdown ke andar mat rakho.

Header clean, balanced aur professional lagna chahiye.

Mobile par yeh sab options ek hi Tools dropdown ke andar rahenge taake screen clean aur responsive lage.

2. Light Mode (Complete Audit)

Light Mode abhi bhi properly work nahi kar raha.

Please complete Light Theme audit karo aur har component ko check karo.

Fix:

Backgrounds
Cards
Inputs
Buttons
Text Colors
Icons
Borders
Dropdowns
Popups
Tables
Lists
Shadows
Hover States

Abhi bhi bohot si jagahon par Dark Mode colors aa rahe hain.

Currency Dropdown, Manage Category Popup aur baqi tamam popups ko bhi Light Mode ke hisaab se properly style karo.

Dark aur Light dono themes mein har component consistent hona chahiye.

3. Mobile Currency Dropdown

Mobile Tools menu ke andar Currency dropdown sahi position par open nahi hota.

Fix:

Dropdown popup ke andar hi open ho.
Side mein bahar na nikle.
Proper width ho.
Proper alignment ho.
Responsive ho.
Z-index issue na ho.
4. Back To Top Button

Back To Top button ko improve karo.

Smooth scrolling use karo.
Click karne par softly top tak scroll ho.
Current behaviour ko polish karo.
Button Add Expense button ke upar proper gap ke saath rahe.
5. Floating Buttons

Back To Top aur Add Expense button kabhi overlap na karein.

Back To Top hamesha Add Expense button ke bilkul upar thore gap ke saath show ho.

Dono buttons har screen size par properly clickable hon.

6. Khata Tracker (Mobile)

Khata Tracker ko complete responsive polish do.

Fix:

Input fields alignment
Equal heights
Proper spacing
Better margins
Responsive layout

Records List:

Cards properly aligned hon.
Avatar alignment improve karo.
Amount alignment improve karo.
Status badge placement improve karo.
Action buttons properly align karo.
List smooth scroll kare.
Sab records properly visible hon.
Overflow issue na ho.
7. Buttons Consistency

App ke tamam buttons ko ek hi design system follow karna chahiye.

"Save Category" button ko reference banao.

Same apply karo:

Height
Padding
Border Radius
Font Size
Font Weight
Icon Spacing
Hover Effect
Click Animation
Shadow

Ye buttons same style follow karein:

Save
Reset
Refresh
Save Record
Save Category
Add Expense
Add Category
Aur tamam Primary Buttons

Abhi bohot buttons ki padding aur height different hai.

Sab buttons visually consistent hone chahiye.

8. Global Font

Poppins font poori application mein apply nahi ho raha.

Please ensure ke har component Poppins font use kare.

Examples:

Header buttons
Tools button
Dropdown items
Popup titles
Menu items
Buttons
Labels
Inputs

Kahin bhi default browser font use nahi hona chahiye.

9. Popup Behaviour

Jab bhi koi popup ya modal open ho:

Background scroll completely disable ho.
Background clickable na ho.
Sirf popup scroll kare agar zarurat ho.

Popup close hote hi page normal ho jaye.

10. Smooth Animations

App mein modern aur lightweight animations add karo.

Examples:

Pages
Smooth fade-in
Cards
Fade + Slide animation
Buttons
Hover animation
Click animation
Soft glow
Dropdowns
Fade + Scale animation
Popups
Smooth open
Smooth close
Background fade
Floating Button
Hover animation
Ripple effect
Lists
Smooth add animation
Smooth delete animation
Smooth filter animation
Progress Bar
Smooth value transition

Animations premium feel deni chahiye aur performance affect nahi honi chahiye.

11. Responsive Review

Desktop, Tablet aur Mobile tino devices par complete review karo.

Fix:

Padding
Margin
Alignment
Font Sizes
Button Sizes
Input Heights
Grid Layout
Overflow
Horizontal Scroll
Dropdown Position
Popup Layout
Card Spacing
Z-index Issues

Har page responsive aur polished hona chahiye.

Final Requirement
Existing functionality change mat karo.
Business logic touch mat karo.
Sirf UI, UX, responsiveness, spacing, animations aur theme consistency improve karo.
Complete app ko Dark Mode aur Light Mode dono mein test karo.
Desktop, Tablet aur Mobile tino screen sizes par manually verify karo ke koi visual issue, overflow, broken alignment ya responsive bug baqi na rahe. App ka final result clean, modern aur production-ready hona chahiye.